 continuously reviews the risk management and internal control systems.","tool":"keyword_search+semantic_search"},{"chunk_id":"tx_2024_ar_0516","company":"Tencent","document_id":"tx_2024_ar","evidence_id":"evidence-3","hop":1,"is_gold":true,"page":null,"report_year":2024,"retrieval_count":1,"score":null,"section":"CORPORATE GOVERNANCE REPORT","sub_query":"committee that continuously reviews risk management and internal controls on behalf of the Board","text":"腾讯 2024 Annual Report - CORPORATE GOVERNANCE REPORT\nframework and an assessment of its internal audit quality to ensure their standards are in compliance with international best\npractices.\nTencent Holdings Limited\n110\nCorporate Governance Report\nEffectiveness of Risk Management and Internal Control\nThe Audit Committee, on behalf of the Board, continuously reviews the risk management and internal control systems.\nThe review process comprises of, among other things, meetings with management of business groups, IA, IC, legal team, and","tool":"keyword_search+semantic_search"},{"chunk_id":"tx_2025_ar_0436","company":"Tencent","document_id":"tx_2025_ar","evidence_id":"evidence-4","hop":1,"is_gold":false,"page":null,"report_year":2025,"retrieval_count":1,"score":null,"section":"CORPORATE GOVERNANCE REPORT","sub_query":"committee that continuously reviews risk management and internal controls on behalf of the Board","text":"腾讯 2025 Annual Report - CORPORATE GOVERNANCE REPORT\nenhancement of risk culture building, the Company has been continuously improving its risk management and internal control\nsystems while enhancing its risk management capabilities to ensure the healthy and sustainable development of the Company.\nThe Board acknowledges its responsibility to ensure that the Company has established and maintained adequate and\neffective risk management and internal control systems. The Board delegates this responsibility to the Audit Committee,","tool":"keyword_search+semantic_search"},{"chunk_id":"tx_2023_ar_0477","company":"Tencent","document_id":"tx_2023_ar","evidence_id":"evidence-5","hop":1,"is_gold":false,"page":null,"report_year":2023,"retrieval_count":1,"score":null,"section":"CORPORATE GOVERNANCE REPORT","sub_query":"committee that continuously reviews risk management and internal controls on behalf of the Board","text":"腾讯 2023 Annual Report - CORPORATE GOVERNANCE REPORT\nculture enhancement, the Company has been continuously improving its risk management and internal control system and\nenhancing risk management capabilities to ensure the healthy and sustainable development of the Company.\nThe Board acknowledges that it is its responsibility to ensure that the Company has established and maintained adequate and\neffective risk management and internal control systems. The Board delegates its responsibility to the Audit Committee to review","tool":"keyword_search+semantic_search"},{"chunk_id":"tx_2024_ar_0349","company":"Tencent","document_id":"tx_2024_ar","evidence_id":"evidence-6","hop":2,"is_gold":false,"page":null,"report_year":2024,"retrieval_count":2,"score":null,"section":"CORPORATE GOVERNANCE REPORT","sub_query":"compliance system overseen by the committee mentioned in the previous step (dependency context: step 1: framework and an assessment of its internal audit quality to ensure their standards are in compliance with international best\npractices.\nAnnual Report 2023\n115\nCorporate Governance Report\nEffectivenes)","text":"腾讯 2024 Annual Report - CORPORATE GOVERNANCE REPORT\noversees the risks undertaken by the Company including determining the level of risk the Company expects and is able\nto take; and\n‧\noversees the Group’s anti-money laundering and sanctions compliance system.\nCorporate Governance Committee\n‧\nreviews the Company’s corporate governance and makes recommendations to the Board;\n‧\nreviews and monitors the Company’s policies and practices on its compliance with legal and regulatory requirements;\n‧","tool":"keyword_search+se