ents;\n‧\ndevelops, reviews and monitors the code of conduct and compliance manual (if any) applicable to employees and\ndirectors;\n‧\nreviews the shareholders communication policy and makes recommendations to the Board where appropriate to","tool":"keyword_search+semantic_search"},{"chunk_id":"tx_2024_ar_0348","company":"Tencent","document_id":"tx_2024_ar","evidence_id":"evidence-9","hop":2,"is_gold":false,"page":null,"report_year":2024,"retrieval_count":1,"score":null,"section":"CORPORATE GOVERNANCE REPORT","sub_query":"compliance system overseen by the committee mentioned in the previous step (dependency context: step 1: framework and an assessment of its internal audit quality to ensure their standards are in compliance with international best\npractices.\nAnnual Report 2023\n115\nCorporate Governance Report\nEffectivenes)","text":"腾讯 2024 Annual Report - CORPORATE GOVERNANCE REPORT\nThe Company’s governance structure of these committees can be summarised as follows:\nAudit Committee\n‧\nhandles the relationship with the Company’s external auditor;\n‧\nreviews the Company’s financial information;\n‧\nexercises oversight of the Company’s financial reporting system;\n‧\nreviews the work done by the Company’s management with respect to risk management and internal control systems;\n‧","tool":"keyword_search+semantic_search"},{"chunk_id":"tx_2023_ar_0387","company":"Tencent","document_id":"tx_2023_ar","evidence_id":"evidence-10","hop":2,"is_gold":true,"page":null,"report_year":2023,"retrieval_count":1,"score":null,"section":"CORPORATE GOVERNANCE REPORT","sub_query":"compliance system mentioned in the 2023 and 2024 annual reports of Tencent (dependency context: step 2: oversees the risks undertaken by the Company including determining the level of risk the Company expects and is able\nto take; and\n‧\noversees the Group’s anti-money laundering and sanctions compliance )","text":"腾讯 2023 Annual Report - CORPORATE GOVERNANCE REPORT\nhandles the relationship with the Company’s external auditor;\n‧\nreviews the Company’s financial information;\n‧\nexercises oversight of the Company’s financial reporting system;\n‧\nreviews the work done by the Company’s management with respect to risk management and internal control systems;\n‧\noversees the risks undertaken by the Company including determining the level of risk the Company expects and is able\nto take; and\n‧\noversees the Group’s anti-money laundering and sanctions compliance system.","tool":"keyword_search+semantic_search"},{"chunk_id":"tx_2023_ar_0479","company":"Tencent","document_id":"tx_2023_ar","evidence_id":"evidence-11","hop":3,"is_gold":false,"page":null,"report_year":2023,"retrieval_count":1,"score":null,"section":"CORPORATE GOVERNANCE REPORT","sub_query":"compliance system mentioned in the 2023 and 2024 annual reports of Tencent (dependency context: step 2: oversees the risks undertaken by the Company including determining the level of risk the Company expects and is able\nto take; and\n‧\noversees the Group’s anti-money laundering and sanctions compliance )","text":"腾讯 2023 Annual Report - CORPORATE GOVERNANCE REPORT\nrisk management requirements and best practices from the internal teams and would discuss in the quarterly Audit Committee\nmeetings if necessary.\nTencent Holdings Limited\n104\nCorporate Governance Report\nThe Board is responsible for overseeing risks that the Company faces, determining the risk appetite of the Company, and\nproactively considering, analysing and formulating strategies to manage the Company’s significant risks to acceptable levels.","tool":"keyword_search+semantic_search"},{"chunk_id":"tx_2023_ar_0492","company":"Tencent","document_id":"tx_2023_ar","evidence_id":"evidence-12","hop":3,"is_gold":false,"page":null,"report_year":2023,"retrieval_count":1,"score":null,"section":"CORPORATE GOVERNANCE REPORT","sub_query":"compliance system mentioned in the 2023 and 2024 annual reports of Tencent (dependency context: step 2: oversees the risks undertaken by the Company including determining the level of risk the Company expects and is able\nto take; and\n‧\noversees the Group’s anti-money laundering and sanctions compliance )","text":"腾讯 2023 Annual Report - CORPORATE GOVERNANCE REPORT\nprocesses. Each business group of the Company, on a regular basis, identifies and assesses any risks that may negatively\nimpact the achievement of its objectives, and formulates appropriate response measures. The Company also provides risk\nmanagement and internal control training for staff on a regular basis.\nTencent Holdings Limited\n106\nCorporate Governance Report\nRisk Management Process","tool":"keyword_search+semantic_search"},{"chunk_id":"tx_2024_ar_0455","company":"Tencent","document_id":"tx_2024_ar","evidence_id":"evidence-13","hop":3,"is_gold":false,"page":null,"report_year":2024,"retrieval_count":1,"score":null,"section":"CORPORATE GOVERNANCE REPORT","sub_query":"compliance system mentioned in the 2023 and 2024 annual reports of Tencent (dependency context: step 2: oversees the risks undertaken by the Company including determining the level of risk the Company expects and is able\nto take; and\n‧\noversees the Group’s anti-money laundering and sanctions compliance )","text":"腾讯 2024 Annual Report - CORPORATE GOVERNANCE REPORT\nOn behalf of the Board, the Audit Committee supervises the overall risk management of the Company and assesses the\nrisk acceptable level, risk ratings and the response strategies for the Company’s risks. The Audit Committee considers that\nmanagement has taken appropriate measures to address and manage the significant risks for which they are responsible at a\nlevel acceptable to the Board.\nTencent Holdings Limited\n102\nCorporate Governance Report","tool":"keyword_search+semantic_search"}],"grounding":{"abstention_reason":null,"complete":true,"final_verdict":"sufficient","hop_recall":1.0,"status":"grounded"},"metrics":{"evidence_count":13,"grounding_status":"grounded","hop_recall":1