activities may not be effective. This may materially and adversely affect our business, brand, financial condition and results of\noperations.\nWe rely on Baidu Union partners for a significant portion of our revenues. If we fail to retain existing Baidu Union partners or attract additional\nmembers, our revenue growth and profitability may be adversely affected.","tool":"keyword_search+semantic_search"},{"chunk_id":"bd_2024_ar_2389","company":"Baidu","document_id":"bd_2024_ar","evidence_id":"evidence-11","hop":1,"is_gold":false,"page":null,"report_year":2024,"retrieval_count":1,"score":null,"section":"ITEM 19.","sub_query":"According to Baidu''s 2024 and 2025 annual reports, what is the entity whose integration may expose Baidu to additional risks?","text":"百度 2024 Annual Report - ITEM 19.\nNetcom, Baidu Online and Hailong Xiang dated May 7, 2018 (incorporated by reference to Exhibit 4.62 of our Annual Report on\nForm 20-F filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission on March 15, 2019)\n4.63\nTranslation of the Amended and Restated Exclusive Equity Purchase and Transfer Option Agreement among Baidu, Inc., Baidu\nNetcom, Baidu Online and Robin Yanhong Li dated May 7, 2018 (incorporated by reference to Exhibit 4.63 of our Annual Report","tool":"keyword_search+semantic_search"},{"chunk_id":"bd_2024_ar_0212","company":"Baidu","document_id":"bd_2024_ar","evidence_id":"evidence-12","hop":2,"is_gold":true,"page":null,"report_year":2024,"retrieval_count":2,"score":null,"section":"ITEM 3.","sub_query":"According to Baidu''s 2024 and 2025 annual reports, how are most communications conducted on the entity identified in the previous step?; annual report exact disclosure; missing fact: Specific information about the entity (e.g., name, nature) and the method of communication (e.g., email, in-person, digital platforms) is missing. (dependency context: step 1: the amended consolidated complaints to be completed by April 22, 2024. Both the iQIYI and Baidu Actions were dismis