iment replay, not a live query.","severity":"info"},{"code":"DEVELOPMENT_BASELINE","message":"Textual 2-hop behavior is a development baseline with known limitations.","severity":"warning"},{"code":"PARTIAL_GOLD_CHAIN","message":"Only 0.500 of the Gold evidence hops were recalled.","severity":"warning"},{"code":"EVIDENCE_EXHAUSTED","message":"The system abstained after the verifier remained insufficient.","severity":"warning"}]}'::jsonb, 'hopcandy-v0.1-step0-2026-08-12', 'd9a031e88fd177efb2e45e1c9093bd0c4e9a2baabdb8a17c1e4df115de7e3c84', 'hopcandy-api-v1', '85bb5af995a4e47a35455cd202e8f8dba8a40f696cdfd6588c90dec819f6c532', true),
  ('textual-model-scale-comparison-qwen3-4b-2048', 70, 'Qwen3-4B vs Qwen3-8B on the same two-hop question - Qwen3-4B', 'model_scale_comparison', 'Ablation', 'Qwen3 model-scale comparison on consumed Development24', '{"answer":"fair value less costs of disposal","api_schema_version":"hopcandy-api-v1","error":null,"evidence":[{"chunk_id":"tx_2024_ar_0979","company":"Tencent","document_id":"tx_2024_ar","evidence_id":"evidence-1","hop":1,"is_gold":true,"page":null,"report_year":2024,"retrieval_count":1,"score":null,"section":"NOTES TO THE CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS","sub_query":"What is the reporting lag method used by Tencent for investments in associates?","text":"腾讯 2024 Annual Report - NOTES TO THE CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS\nrecoverable amounts were determined using fair value less costs of disposal where the respective fair values had been\ndetermined according to the principle set out in Note 4.3.\nTencent Holdings Limited\n218\nNotes to the Consolidated Financial Statements\nFor the year ended 31 December 2024\n22 INVESTMENTS IN ASSOCIATES (continued)\nInvestments in associates have been accounted for by using equity method based on the financial information of the","tool":"keyword_search+semantic_search"},{"chunk_id":"tx_2023_ar_0714","company":"Tencent","document_id":"tx_2023_ar","evidence_id":"evidence-2","hop":1,"is_gold":false,"page":null,"report_year":2023,"retrieval_count":1,"score":null,"section":"NOTES TO THE CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS","sub_query":"What is the reporting lag method used by Tencent for investments in associates?","text":"腾讯 2023 Annual Report - NOTES TO THE CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS\nTencent Holdings Limited\n148\nNotes to the Consolidated Financial Statements\nFor the year ended 31 December 2023\n2\nSUMMARY OF MATERIAL ACCOUNTING POLICIES (continued)\n2.4 Investments under equity accounting method (continued)\n(d)\nInvestments in associates/joint ventures achieved in stages\nThe cost of associates/joint ventures acquired in stages, except for the change from an associate to a joint","tool":"keyword_search+semantic_search"},{"chunk_id":"tx_2024_ar_0660","company":"Tencent","document_id":"tx_2024_ar","evidence_id":"evidence-3","hop":1,"is_gold":false,"page":null,"report_year":2024,"retrieval_count":1,"score":null,"section":"NOTES TO THE CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS","sub_query":"What is the reporting lag method used by Tencent for investments in associates?","text":"腾讯 2024 Annual Report - NOTES TO THE CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS\nAssociates are all entities over which the Group has significant influence but not control or joint control,\ngenerally but not necessarily accompanying a holding of between 20% and 50% of the voting rights.\nInvestments in associates are accounted for using the equity method of accounting. The Group’s investments\nin associates include underlying goodwill identified on acquisition, net of any accumulated impairment loss.\n(b)\nJoint ventures","tool":"keyword_search+semantic_search"},{"chunk_id":"tx_2025_ar_0989","company":"Tencent","document_id":"tx_2025_ar","evidence_id":"evidence-4","hop":1,"is_gold":false,"page":null,"report_year":2025,"retrieval_count":1,"score":null,"section":"NOTES TO THE CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS","sub_query":"What is the reporting lag method used by Tencent for investments in associates?","text":"腾讯 2025 Annual Report - NOTES TO THE CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS\nNotes to the Consolidated Financial Statements\nFor the year ended 31 December 2025\n22 INVESTMENTS IN ASSOCIATES (continued)\nInvestments in associates have been accounted for by using equity method based on the financial information of the\nassociates prepared under the accounting policies generally consistent with those of the Group.\nThe Group’s share of the results, the revenues, the aggregated assets (including goodwill) and liabilities of its associates,","tool":"keyword_search+semantic_search"},{"chunk_id":"tx_2024_ar_0664","company":"Tencent","document_id":"tx_2024_ar","evidence_id":"evidence-5","hop":1,"is_gold":false,"page":null,"report_year":2024,"retrieval_count":1,"score":null,"section":"NOTES TO THE CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS","sub_query":"What is the reporting lag method used by Tencent for investments in associates?","text":"腾讯 2024 Annual Report - NOTES TO THE CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS\ninterests in the entity, including any unsecured long-term receivables, the Group does not recognise further\nlosses, unless it has incurred legal or constructive obligations or made payments on behalf of the entity.\nThe Group determines at each reporting date whether there is any objective evidence that investments\naccounted for using the equity method, including investments in associates and joint ventures, are impaired.","tool":"keyword_search+semantic_search"},{"chunk_id":"tx_2025_ar_0988","company":"Tencent","document_id":"tx_2025_ar","evidence_id":"evidence-6","hop":2,"is_gold":false,"page":null,"report_year":2025,"retrieval_count":1,"score":null,"section":"NOTES TO THE CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS","sub_query":"What is the reporting lag method used by Baidu for most investees according to their 2025 annual report? (dependency context: step 1: recoverable amounts were determined using fair value less costs of disposal where the respective fair values had been\ndetermined according to the principle set out in Note 4.3.\nTencent Holdings Limite)","text":"腾讯 2025 Annual Report - NOTES TO THE CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS\nDuring the year ended 31 December 2025, net impairment reversals of approximately RMB3,427 million (2024: net impairment\nprovision of approximately RMB8,250 million) had been recognised for investments in associates, and the majority of these\ninvestments’ recoverable amounts were determined using fair value less costs of disposal where the respective fair values had\nbeen determined according to the principle set out in Note 4.3.\nTencent Holdings Limited\n226","tool":"keyword_search+semantic_search"},{"chunk_id":"tx_2023_ar_1019","company":"Tencent","document_id":"tx_2023_ar","evidence_id":"evidence-7","hop":2,"is_gold":false,"page":null,"report_year":2023,"retrieval_count":1,"score":null,"section":"NOTES TO THE CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS","sub_query":"What is the reporting lag method used by Baidu for most investees according to their 2025 annual report? (dependency context: step 1: recoverable amounts were determined using fair value less costs of disposal where the respective fair values had been\ndetermined according to the principle set out in Note 4.3.\nTencent Holdings Limite)","text":"腾讯 2023 Annual Report - NOTES TO THE CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS\nThe key assumptions used for the calculation of the recoverable amounts of the CGUs (or groups of CGUs) under\nimpairment testing are as follows:\nFor goodwill attributable to the Group’s online game business within VAS segment, the recoverable amount was\ndetermined using fair value less costs of disposal where the fair value was determined as Level 3 according to the\nprinciple set out in Note 4.3. Fair value less costs of disposal was primarily determined based on ratios of EV (enterprise","tool":"keyword_search+semantic_search"},{"chunk_id":"tx_2023_ar_1032","company":"Tencent","document_id":"tx_2023_ar","evidence_id":"evidence-8","hop":2,"is_gold":false,"page":null,"report_year":2023,"retrieval_count":1,"score":null,"section":"NOTES TO THE CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS","sub_query":"What is the reporting lag method used by Baidu for most investees according to their 2025 annual report? (dependency context: step 1: recoverable amounts were determined using fair value less costs of disposal where the respective fair values had been\ndetermined according to the principle set out in Note 4.3.\nTencent Holdings Limite)","text":"腾讯 2023 Annual Report - NOTES TO THE CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS\nDuring the year ended 31 December 2023, an aggregate impairment loss of approximately RMB6,847 million (2022: RMB25,689\nmillion) had been recognised for associates with impairment indicators, and the majority of these associates’ recoverable amounts\nwere determined using fair value less costs of disposal where the respective fair values had been determined according to the\nprinciple set out in Note 4.3.\nAnnual Report 2023\n225\nNotes to the Consolidated Financial Statements","tool":"keyword_search+semantic_search"},{"chunk_id":"tx_2024_ar_0966","company":"Tencent","document_id":"tx_2024_ar","evidence_id":"evidence-9","hop":2,"is_gold":false,"page":null,"report_year":2024,"retrieval_count":1,"score":null,"section":"NOTES TO THE CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS","sub_query":"What is the reporting lag method used by Baidu for most investees according to their 2025 annual report? (dependency context: step 1: recoverable amounts were determined using fair value less costs of disposal where the respective fair values had been\ndetermined according to the principle set out in Note 4.3.\nTencent Holdings Limite)","text":"腾讯 2024 Annual Report - NOTES TO THE CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS\nprinciple set out in Note 4.3. Fair value less costs of disposal was primarily determined based on ratios of EV (enterprise\nvalue) divided by EBITDA of several comparable public companies (range: 10-17x) (2023: range: 11-19x) multiplied by\nthe EBITDA of the related CGU (or group of CGUs) and liquidity discount for lack of marketability at a range of 10% to\n20% (2023: 10% to 20%). The comparable public companies were chosen based on factors such as industry similarity,","tool":"keyword_search+semantic_search"},{"chunk_id":"tx_2025_ar_0987","company":"Tencent","document_id":"tx_2025_ar","evidence_id":"evidence-10","hop":2,"is_gold":false,"page":null,"report_year":2025,"retrieval_count":1,"score":null,"section":"NOTES TO THE CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS","sub_query":"What is the reporting lag method used by Baidu for most investees according to their 2025 annual report? (dependency context: step 1: recoverable amounts were determined using fair value less costs of disposal where the respective fair values had been\ndetermined according to the principle set out in Note 4.3.\nTencent Holdings Limite)","text":"腾讯 2025 Annual Report - NOTES TO THE CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS\nrates, terminal growth rates and discount rates. In respect of the recoverable amount based on fair value less costs of disposal,\nthe amount is calculated with reference to their respective market prices for listed investments, or using certain key valuation\nassumptions including the selection of comparable companies, recent market transactions, liquidity discounts adopted for lack of\nmarketability for unlisted investments.","tool":"keyword_search+semantic_search"}],"grounding":{"abstention_reason":null,"complete":true,"final_verdict":"sufficient","hop_recall":0.5,"status":"partial"},"metrics":{"evidence_count":10,"grounding_status":"partial","hop_recall":0.5,"iterations":1,"latency_ms":3386.31,"replans":0,"tool_calls":2},"mode":"replay","model":"Qwen3-4B","plan":[{"depends_on":[],"iteration":1,"plan_id":"plan-1-1","status":"done","step_id":1,"sub_query":"What is the reporting lag method used by Tencent for investments in associates?","tool":"semantic_search"},{"depends_on":[1],"iteration":1,"plan_id":"plan-1-2","status":"done","step_id":2,"sub_query":"What is the reporting lag method used by Baidu for most investees according to their 2025 annual report?","tool":"semantic_search"}],"provenance":{"case_id":"textual-model-scale-comparison","fixture_version":"hopcandy-v0.1-step0-2026-08-12","source_kind":"frozen_replay","source_result_sha256":"d03cb0d09620e6db5b6b3038969431cb9504c86a4c02595832c691940b1c3939","source_row_sha256":"ad43e3a5c51d8e754a9b0d40cda56e23854de2c1372112b8559f1fd73de73d1b"},"question":"According to Tencent''s 2024 and Baidu''s 2025 annual reports, what reporting lag does Baidu use fo